# Units and containers that must always be running on nezopt. `pokoin-ops sentinel --role nezopt`
# reports each one as crit when it is not active/running (Secretary "Server health").
# Format: `name.service` = user unit, `system:name.service` = system unit, `container:name`.
# Source: services-inventory.md 2026-10-27 (KEEP+ALERT long-running units).

